  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the external bisector of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8736;</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> with vertices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>5,2</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2,3</mn></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
